{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本本州暴雨持續，造成至少一人死亡，40多人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">京都、福井等地周三下暴雨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026X1mrdwkAn31788958076.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">共同社報道，靜岡縣一名工人遇泥石流死亡。愛知縣有40多人在疏散過程中跌到受輕傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">富士山發生泥石流，富士宮五合目一個停車場有三輛車被泥沙掩埋，未有傷亡報告。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263fdkPW4oJR1788958096.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T12:59:36.096791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}